menu "RoboHub BMP180 module"

config RH_BOARD_BMP180_MODULE
    bool "BMP180 temperature, pressure and altitude sensor breakout"
    select RH_DRV_BMP180
    default n
    help
      The Bosch BMP180 sensor breakout. Selecting it brings in the driver and
      the bus and timer the breakout needs; an application that does not fit the
      module pays for none of it.

endmenu
